for what its worth, the scrFrame that Jenni created with data2oscr appears to be identical to the one that you created with that code.  I'm pondering how the same scrFrame can produce two different results like this.... if indeed they do

On Fri, Mar 31, 2017 at 12:06 PM, Chris SUtherland <chris...@gmail.com> wrote:

> Hi Jenni, and everyone,
>
>
